{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56584","headline":"下鹿苑寺 · 大宗","name":"下鹿苑寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹿苑重兴梵宇宽，天台罗汉逐云端。\n雨花石上成砆坐，瀑布泉边悟水观。\n四壁无邻山鸟待，深岩有洞老猿看。\n当时婺岭龙回去，今日还归护法坛。\n（同治《嵊县志》卷二十五。\n此首承陶敏先生告。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"大宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}